---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteNav from '../../components/SiteNav.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<Layout title="Upsell Calculator — Maxq Analytics">
  <SiteNav />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-6 bg-ink text-cream">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <a href="/#add-ons" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-white/40 hover:text-white/70 transition-colors mb-8">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"/></svg>
        All add-ons
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-medium text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-400/10 border border-emerald-400/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Grow</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-medium text-brand-300 bg-brand-600/10 border border-brand-600/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Add-on</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-black mb-6 leading-none" style="font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px); letter-spacing: -0.04em">Upsell Calculator</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-cream/55 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">Pick a client from the dropdown. The calculator instantly shows what they would pay under each of your pricing plans — based on their last twelve months of actual usage. No guesswork, no manual data prep.</p>
      <a href="https://calendly.com/philip-boontje" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-cream text-ink font-semibold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full hover:bg-white transition-colors text-sm">
        See it for your client base
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-cream">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-14">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">How it works</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">Three steps from data to conversation.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-0">

        <div class="flex gap-8 pb-12 border-b border-ink/8">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">1</div>
          <div class="pt-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">Select a client</h3>
            <p class="text-ink/60 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">Choose any client from the dropdown. The calculator immediately loads their full LTM usage profile from the Semantic Nexus — active user counts, transaction volumes, feature adoption, and any usage that maps to your pricing structure. No manual exports, no copy-paste.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-8 py-12 border-b border-ink/8">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">2</div>
          <div class="pt-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">Compare plans against real usage</h3>
            <p class="text-ink/60 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">Each of your pricing plans is applied against the client's actual volumes. The calculator computes projected revenue per plan side by side — Standard, Plus, All-in, Custom — so you can see exactly what each option would have generated over the same period.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-8 pt-12">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">3</div>
          <div class="pt-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">Walk in with the number</h3>
            <p class="text-ink/60 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">The revenue difference — in euros and percentage — tells you exactly what a plan upgrade is worth for this specific client. Your CS or sales team walks into the conversation with a data-backed case, not a gut feeling.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Example output -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-warm">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-10">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Example output</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">What the calculator produces.</h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Mockup -->
      <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl border border-ink/10 overflow-hidden shadow-sm">

        <!-- Client selector bar -->
        <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-ink/8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/30 uppercase tracking-wider">Client</span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-warm border border-ink/10 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5">
              <span class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">DXM Manufacturing Ltd.</span>
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-ink/30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/25 uppercase tracking-wider">Org #6266</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
            <div class="text-right">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/30 uppercase tracking-wider">LTM period</p>
              <p class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Apr 2025 – Apr 2026</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-right">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/30 uppercase tracking-wider">Current plan</p>
              <p class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Standard</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-right">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/30 uppercase tracking-wider">Actual revenue (LTM)</p>
              <p class="font-black text-ink text-lg" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">€4,122</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Plan comparison -->
        <div class="p-6">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/30 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Revenue if moved to plan</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3">

            <!-- Standard -->
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink/10 p-4">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/40 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Standard</p>
              <p class="font-black text-2xl text-ink mb-1" style="letter-spacing: -0.03em">€4,514</p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-emerald-600 font-semibold">+€391</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/30">·</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/50">+9%</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Plus -->
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink/10 p-4">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/40 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Plus</p>
              <p class="font-black text-2xl text-ink mb-1" style="letter-spacing: -0.03em">€4,402</p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-emerald-600 font-semibold">+€279</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/30">·</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/50">+7%</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- All-in — highlighted -->
            <div class="rounded-xl border-2 border-brand-600 bg-brand-50 p-4 relative">
              <div class="absolute -top-2.5 left-3">
                <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold text-white bg-brand-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Best uplift</span>
              </div>
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 mt-1">All-in</p>
              <p class="font-black text-2xl text-ink mb-1" style="letter-spacing: -0.03em">€8,425</p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-600 font-bold">+€4,303</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/30">·</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-600 font-semibold">+104%</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Custom -->
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink/10 bg-ink/2 p-4">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/40 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Custom</p>
              <p class="font-black text-2xl text-ink mb-1" style="letter-spacing: -0.03em">€9,379</p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-emerald-600 font-semibold">+€5,257</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/30">·</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/50">+128%</span>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- LTM usage volumes -->
        <div class="px-6 pb-5">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/30 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Key usage volumes (LTM)</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3">
            <div class="bg-warm rounded-lg px-4 py-3">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/35 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Members</p>
              <p class="font-black text-ink text-lg" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">1,037</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-warm rounded-lg px-4 py-3">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/35 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Payments</p>
              <p class="font-black text-ink text-lg" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">1,235</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-warm rounded-lg px-4 py-3">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/35 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Communications</p>
              <p class="font-black text-ink text-lg" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">2,118</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="px-6 py-3 border-t border-ink/8">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/25 uppercase tracking-wider">Data refreshed from Semantic Nexus · Volumes reflect last 12 months of actual platform activity</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What you get -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-cream">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-14">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">What you get</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">Everything your team needs to act.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-warm rounded-xl p-7 border border-ink/8">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 17V7m0 10a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V7a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m0 10a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 7a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m0 0v10m0-10a2 2 0 012 2h2a2 2 0 012-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2a2 2 0 00-2 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Per-client LTM usage profile</h3>
          <p class="text-ink/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">Members, payment volumes by method, communication activity, and add-on usage — all pulled live from the Semantic Nexus per selected client. No manual data entry.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-warm rounded-xl p-7 border border-ink/8">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Plan-by-plan revenue projection</h3>
          <p class="text-ink/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">Each of your pricing plans applied against the same client's actual usage — so you're comparing apples to apples, not guessing what a tier change would cost or generate.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-warm rounded-xl p-7 border border-ink/8">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Revenue delta in EUR and %</h3>
          <p class="text-ink/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">The difference between actual and projected revenue — per plan, in both absolute euros and percentage. The exact figure to anchor a pricing conversation on.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-warm rounded-xl p-7 border border-ink/8">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Repeatable — for any client, any time</h3>
          <p class="text-ink/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">Switch clients in the dropdown and the whole calculator updates instantly. Your CS team can run this independently for every account review, every quarter, without involving data or finance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who it's for -->
  <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-warm">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="md:flex items-start gap-16">
        <div class="shrink-0 mb-8 md:mb-0">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Who it's for</div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em; max-width: 280px">The right fit.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-ink/60 leading-relaxed max-w-xl pt-1">
          <p>B2B platforms with recurring clients on differentiated pricing plans — where clients generate measurable usage volumes (transactions, members, communications, events) that can be mapped to plan-specific rates.</p>
          <p>Works best when you have at least 6 months of usage history per client and a pricing structure with multiple tiers. The bigger the gap between your cheapest and most capable plan, the more the calculator reveals.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-ink text-cream text-center">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">Get started</div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-black mb-4" style="letter-spacing: -0.03em">Know the number <span class="text-brand-300">before the conversation.</span></h2>
      <p class="text-cream/50 mb-10 leading-relaxed">We'll wire the calculator to your client data and run the first set of calculations together — so your team walks out of the first session with real numbers for real clients.</p>
      <a href="https://calendly.com/philip-boontje" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-cream text-ink font-semibold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full hover:bg-white transition-colors text-sm">
        Schedule a call
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>
